[193]
t=Spindle Ramp Up Max Time
d=Maximum time (in seconds) allowed for the spindle to rampup to speed before a spindle time-out message is posted.

[194]
t=Spindle Shot-pin Switch Make Max Time
d=Maximum time (in seconds) allowed for the spindle shot-pin switch to change state before a shot-pin extend/retract failure message is posted.

[195]
t=Spindle Switch Settling In Max Time
d=Maximum time (in seconds) allowed that the spindle in-gear and shot-pin switches must stay at state before it is considered a good make.

[196]
t=Spindle Range Switch Make Max Time
d=Maximum time (in seconds) allowed for the spindle Hi/Low range switch to change state.

[197]
t=Gear settling-in Max Time
d=Maximum time (in seconds) for the requested spindle gear to settle into place.

[198]
t=Shot-pin settling-in Max Time
d=Maximum time (in seconds) for the spindle shot-pin to be inserted all the way into the carrier plate.

[199]
t=Backing out/in Max Time
d=Maximum time (in seconds) allowed for the carrier plate to back out of a stuck position.

[200]
t=Maximum Number of Retries
d=Maximum number of re-tries attempted before a Hi/Low range switch failure message is posted.

[201]
t=Maximum Shifting Torque
d=Maximum allowable shifting torque, expressed as spindle load, above which the next retry is attempted immediately.

[202]
t=Spndl Temp Gain
d=Spindle temperature correction scale factor in inches/degree or millimeters/degree centigrade.

[203]
t=Number of GPAUF Boards
d=The number of GPAUF boards in the system.  This must be set to zero when no GPAUFs are installed.
    
